{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"Fresh replay confirms the key hazard: the helper alternates between rows 26 and 32 near the lower gate, and one extra patrol cycle can remove it without increasing reward. I’m now comparing the preserved short gate/stage probes to identify which USE timing opens the next reachable region, while discarding helper-loss states."}}
